1001:        \item If $a = 1$, then there are two reddening sequences: one of length 2 and the other of length 3.
1005:        \item If $a \geq 2$, then there is exactly one reddening sequence of length 2, which produces a mutable subquiver with equality.
1006:        There are no other reddening sequences.
