+the static outlier cycle fails.  Largest-incidence greedy mutates the wrong
+branches.  Uniform reduced-word restarts see a 4*3^(L-1) language.  The most
+tempting by-hand ansatz, pure alternation on the lightest edge, omits the
+source-cycle center and the conjugate mirror and fails.  The separately
