Consider the quiver $R''$ shown in Figure~\ref{fig:positroid reddening 2}.
This quiver has a reddening sequence 
$$\mathbf S'' = 7, 4, 1, 8, 7, 5, 4, 1, 9, 8, 7, 2, 5, 4, 3, 1, 7, 8, 5, 3, 1, 7,$$ 
with associated permutation $ (2,5) (3,8) (4,9,7)$.
