    Let $Q$ be the quiver in Figure~\ref{fig:triangular-dreaded-tori}, a triangular extension of two copies of the Dreaded Torus (see Example~\ref{fig:dreaded torus}).
    Then $Q$ has a mutation cycle of length $24$: 
